    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From the Louis Vuitton 2026 Fall-Winter women's collection comes this oversized Noé Jeroboam bucket bag, which carries forward the iconic silhouette and drawstring closure of the classic Noé. The new design arrives in an extra-large size of 36cm long x 45cm high x 26cm wide, and is adorned with vertical leather straps and a luggage tag. Crafted from Epi grained cowhide, the bag showcases a finely textured, lustrous finish, available in two colorways: tan and forest green.",
      "url": null,
