      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From the men's collection, this Keepall Extendable 35 bag is crafted from suede calfskin, with a standout feature: the interior is lined with a Monogram-printed silk technical fabric, and the bag can be expanded via a double-zip opening. It also comes with a clever 'water-reactive protective cover' that reveals the Monogram pattern when it comes into contact with water—not only shielding the leather from rain but adding a playful touch.",
      "url": null,
